6	/**
7	 * Normalizes a create request's address to its canonical form — trimmed, whitespace
8	 * collapsed, upper-cased and with common street-type abbreviations expanded (see
9	 * {@link Addresses#normalize(String)}) — storing the result back on the body so later
10	 * steps compare, persist and return the canonical value. Runs after
11	 * {@link ValidateOwnerFields} has confirmed the address is not blank once normalized and
12	 * published the body; mutates that same instance in place.
13	 */
